        <item>
            <title><![CDATA[Hopeful Futures]]></title>
            <link>https://kerostig.org/call/elsevier-prefiguring-hopeful-futures/</link>
            <guid>elsevier-prefiguring-hopeful-futures</guid>
            <pubDate>Tue, 11 Aug 2026 10:27:21 GMT</pubDate>
            <content:encoded><![CDATA[<div>
    
    
    <p>This special issue invites submissions exploring how we might prefigure hopeful futures through research, creative practice, and imagination. The call seeks contributions that engage with optimistic visions of tomorrow while grounding these aspirations in rigorous analysis and critical engagement with contemporary challenges.</p>
    
    
    <h2>Potential topics</h2>
    <ul>
        
        <li>Prefiguration and future studies</li>
        
        <li>Hope and optimism in futures research</li>
        
        <li>Imagining positive futures</li>
        
        <li>Alternative futures scenarios</li>
        
        <li>Speculative fiction and futures thinking</li>
        
    </ul>
    
    
    <h2>Timeline</h2>
    <ul>
        
        <li>December 31, 2026: Full paper submission deadline</li>
        
    </ul>
    
    
</div>]]></content:encoded>
